 0 |----------+----------
   |******    |
   |      **  |
   |        * |
-6 |          |
   +---------------------
    -1        0         1
    * 1/x
fcalc> ! A point that fails or isn't real has no mark.
fcalc> plot sqrt(x) for x from -1 to 1 size 21, 5
